    "status": "approved",
    "summary": "Hot-swap WebSocket reconnection for in-flight SDK streams. When a WebSocket connection drops during a long-running agent session, the client transparently reconnects and the server swaps the new connection into the existing session's writer, preserving session state and replaying missed events. No user intervention required.\n",
